<title>UK: Korea Exchange Bank sets $200 million one-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Korea Exchange Bank sets $200 million one-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and RZB Vienna.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA EXCHANGE BANK 85590.KS</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +45 BP    PAY DATE    27.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.05</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/GB/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.03	SELL CONC  0.02	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
